## Overview

SmartyStreets provides real-time address validation and autocomplete functionality. This integration uses:
- **US Street Address API** - Validates and standardizes US addresses
- **US Autocomplete API** - Provides address suggestions as users type

### Benefits
- Real-time address validation
- Autocomplete suggestions (reduces typing)
- Standardized address format
- Reduces delivery errors
- Extracts components (street, city, state, zipcode)

